cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COBRA in your research, please cite the SBCCI 2026 paper: https://doi.org/10.1109/SBCCI69725.2026.11706804"
type: software
title: "COBRA: A Circuit-Level Open-Source Based RFIC AI-Assisted Optimizer"
abstract: >-
  COBRA is an open-source, AI-assisted circuit-level optimizer for RF integrated
  circuit design. It combines circuit simulation with Xyce or VACASK, S-parameter
  prediction from ONNX surrogate models built with ORCA, goal-driven optimization
  with Optuna and optional full-wave fine-tuning with Palace.
